flowchart TD
    S[Scheduler] -->|round-robin| P[ping actor]
    S -->|round-robin| Q[pong actor]
    
    P -->|send MSG_PING| QM[(pong mailbox)]
    Q -->|send MSG_PONG| PM[(ping mailbox)]
    
    QM -->|pop| Q
    PM -->|pop| P
    
    style S fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style P fill:#bbf,stroke:#333
    style Q fill:#bbf,stroke:#333
    style QM fill:#bfb,stroke:#333
    style PM fill:#bfb,stroke:#333